abstract: >-
  A Chinese learning course, source synthesis, and reproducible experiment
  suite for studying language-model weights, activations, transformer
  circuits, representation basis choices, redundant mechanisms, steering
  controls, reasoning, autoregressive feedback, and safety-related routing.
keywords:
  - mechanistic interpretability
  - transformer circuits
  - large language models
  - causal interventions
  - education
